flowchart TD
  S([Dispatcher opens an incident]) --> R[Determine needed resources:<br/>ambulances = ceil people/4, 1..3<br/>+ fire team / fire truck / police by type]
  R --> L[For each needed type: list AVAILABLE<br/>resources ordered by Haversine distance]
  L --> M{Enough available<br/>resources?}
  M -- no --> MS[Show what is missing<br/>e.g. missing: 1 fire truck]
  M -- yes --> SH[Show recommendation]
  MS --> SH
  SH --> CH{Dispatcher<br/>decision}
  CH -- accept --> SEL[Selected = recommended resources]
  CH -- manual --> MAN[Dispatcher selects resources<br/>from the available list]
  SEL & MAN --> LK[Lock the selected resources<br/>in the database]
  LK --> AV{All still<br/>AVAILABLE?}
  AV -- no --> ER[409: resource no longer available<br/>reload recommendation] --> L
  AV -- yes --> AS[Resources BUSY, create assignments<br/>ambulances: transport ASSIGNED]
  AS --> ST[Incident DISPATCHED,<br/>first dispatch time saved]
  ST --> E([Crews see the emergency])
